    "description": "At Zebra, we are a community of innovators who come together to create new ways of working. United by curiosity and a culture of caring, we develop smart solutions that anticipate our customer’s and partner’s needs and solve their challenges.\n\nBeing part of Zebra Nation means you are seen, heard, valued, and respected. Drawing from our unique perspectives, we collaborate to deliver on our purpose. Here you are part of a team pushing boundaries today to redefine the work of tomorrow for organizations, their employees, and those they serve.\n\nYou’ll have opportunities to learn and lead in a forward-thinking environment, defining your path to a fulfilling career while channeling your skills toward causes you care about—locally and globally.\n\nCome make an impact every day at Zebra.\n\nAs a WLAN Testing and Solutions Engineer in Holtsville, NY, you will join the Connectivity team within the Zebra Enterprise Mobility and Visibility organization. Our mission is to deliver seamless, robust voice and data network connectivity solutions to our enterprise customers worldwide. These wireless configurations act as the critical lifelines powering mission-critical business applications, ensuring warehouse personnel, healthcare workers, and retail staff can run their operations globally without interruption.\n\nYou will play a vital role in validating, designing, and testing complex customer use cases for our next-generation WLAN and Bluetooth solutions. By maintaining and updating our core lab environments and developing automated test suites, you directly contribute to the quality and reliability of the connectivity modules inside millions of Zebra devices globally. Your work will directly expand our value proposition, ensuring that our mobile hardware remains the industry benchmark for wireless performance and seamless enterprise-grade roaming.\n\nLocation: Role is based in Holtsville, NY - Hybrid/3 days onsite",
